Copyright (c) NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
Licensed under Apache-2.0. Linked from the installed SDK, HoloInfer included; not
redistributed.

NVIDIA TensorRT and the CUDA Toolkit
Copyright (c) NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
Under NVIDIA's licenses, installed with them. Used through the installed SDK and CUDA;
